{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-03-20 21:00:00', 'title': 'CLEVELAND CLINIC AND IBM UNVEIL FIRST QUANTUM COMPUTER DEDICATED TO HEALTHCARE RESEARCH', 'text': 'IBM QUANTUM SYSTEM ONE DEPLOYED AT CLEVELAND CLINIC AS PART OF LANDMARK 10-YEAR PARTNERSHIP CLEVELAND AND ARMONK, N.Y. , MARCH 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY,\xa0CLEVELAND CLINIC AND IBM (NYSE: IBM) OFFICIALLY UNVEILED THE FIRST DEPLOYMENT OF AN ONSITE PRIVATE SECTOR IBM-MANAGED QUANTUM COMPUTER IN THE UNITED STATES.'}